{'symbol': 'ALB', 'date': '2022-04-29 06:45:00', 'title': 'ALBEMARLE ANNOUNCES NEW SUPPLY CHAIN LEADERSHIP', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , APRIL 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALBEMARLE CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: ALB), A LEADER IN THE GLOBAL SPECIALTY CHEMICALS INDUSTRY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT\xa0MARIA BRENNAN\xa0HAS JOINED THE COMPANY AS CHIEF SUPPLY CHAIN OFFICER, EFFECTIVE\xa0APRIL 29, 2022.'}